<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.update-skeleton {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>如何识别 whole-node/container update 中隐藏的 identity replacement？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>比较每次 update 前后的 full-tree relative structural path -> effective identity skeleton。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Strict update mutations SHALL preserve the complete full-tree identity skeleton。</?>
    <rationale ?>target map 可能决定 ancestor 的 fallback identity；只比较 identity set 又无法发现 swap 或 hidden move，全树结构路径 skeleton 同时闭合这些绕过。</?>
    <evidence ?>TREE_UPDATE #root:body::0 可在 require-elements 下把 #old 原地替换为 #new。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.occupied-destination {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>strict add/move 如何处理已占用 assignment destination？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>不得覆盖 identified subtree；先显式 delete，或选择空目标/list insertion。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Strict add and move SHALL reject assignment-style destinations that would overwrite an existing identified subtree。</?>
    <rationale ?>setPathValue 的 add 对 property/map 是 replace，move 又复用 add；不加 destination guard 会继续形成 identity replacement bypass。</?>
    <evidence ?>TREE_ADD #root:body 与 move 到 occupied map slot 会静默移除原 identity。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.structural-expression {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>合法 identity replacement 如何表达？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>旧节点 delete + 新节点 add；位置变化使用 move。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Identity replacement SHALL use explicit delete plus add, and identified-node relocation SHALL use move。</?>
    <rationale ?>显式结构 mutation 保留 identity authority、precondition、审计和 move 语义。</?>
    <evidence ?>项目级 XNL Identity attractor 与已提升 xnl-mutation-transaction behavior。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.identity-authority {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>Strict continuity 是否只比较 effective identity 字符串？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>否。比较 identity 字符串及其 raw authority source：explicit #id 或 metadata compatibility fallback。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Strict update identity descriptors SHALL preserve both identity value and authority source。</?>
    <rationale ?>#id 是 diff 对齐和 move 识别的身份权威，不是普通 payload；同值 fallback 切换会改变权威来源，不能由 whole-node update 隐式完成。</?>
    <evidence ?>项目 Identity attractor、用户澄清，以及 metadata fallback 的兼容边界。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.extend-order {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>Extend child 重排应当如何进入 mutation 链？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>由 diff 生成显式 same-level move，不更新 extend.order 容器。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Identified Extend child reorder SHALL be represented by explicit move mutations and SHALL preserve diff/strict-apply parity。</?>
    <rationale ?>Extend 的 order 表示结构位置；把它作为 payload update 会隐藏移动，也与 ordered full-tree identity continuity 冲突。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前 diffExtend 对 order 发 TREE_UPDATE，setPathValue 的 Extend ListIndex 同时写 order 与 children[tag]。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.direct-metadata-fallback {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>Strict identity mode 如何处理直接修改 metadata fallback id？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>当节点没有 explicit #id、metadata id 正承担 effective identity 时拒绝；已有 explicit #id 时保留现有 compatibility 行为。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Strict identity mode SHALL reject direct mutation of an effective metadata fallback identity without promoting metadata id to ordinary diff payload。</?>
    <rationale ?>metadata fallback 是兼容身份权威；接受成功 no-op 会掩盖调用方试图改身份，而全局把 metadata id 当字段比较又会破坏既有 identity mode。</?>
    <evidence ?>Fresh AttractorCheck 对 resolveDirectElementIdTarget 与 applySingle metadata-id skip 的审查。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #reject-xnl-identity-replacement-bypass.extend-retag {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>同 identity Extend child 修改 tag 时如何保持 tag-keyed storage 一致？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>diff 用 move.destinationKey 同时承载新 children key 与目标 index，再更新 child tag；strict 在 batch 最终验证 coherence。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Extend retag SHALL use an explicit move destination key plus payload update and SHALL satisfy a batch-final order/key/tag coherence invariant。</?>
    <rationale ?>只更新 child.tag 会让 children[oldTag]、order 与节点 tag 分裂；逐 mutation 校验又会误伤合法 move-then-retag 原子批次。</?>
    <evidence ?>Fresh AttractorCheck 对 ExtendBody、parser tag-key storage 与 diffDataElement tag update 的审查。</?>
  )
  >
)>
